<view class="kc-landing">
  <view class="kc-landing__intro">
    <text class="kc-landing__eyebrow">無界啟程 BOOUNDLESS</text>
    <text class="kc-landing__title">車輛及保養紀錄</text>
    <text class="kc-landing__description">記下車款、里程和保養日期，方便日後查看。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="kc-landing__features" aria-label="服務內容">
    <view class="kc-landing__feature">
      <text class="kc-landing__feature-title">車輛資料</text>
      <text class="kc-landing__feature-hint">保存車款、年份、車牌及目前里程。</text>
    </view>
    <view class="kc-landing__feature">
      <text class="kc-landing__feature-title">保養紀錄</text>
      <text class="kc-landing__feature-hint">記錄保養項目、日期和當時里程。</text>
    </view>
    <view class="kc-landing__feature">
      <text class="kc-landing__feature-title">琴澳出行資訊</text>
      <text class="kc-landing__feature-hint">查閱澳門及橫琴的自駕出行資料。</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="kc-landing__cta">
    <primary-button block bind:tap="onEnter">進入小程序</primary-button>
    <secondary-button block bind:tap="onLogin">我已有帳戶</secondary-button>
  </view>

  <text class="kc-landing__footer">車輛及保養紀錄 · 琴澳出行資訊</text>
</view>
